# Build output and dependencies
/_build/
/cover/
/deps/
/doc/
*.beam
*.ez

# Hex package tarballs from `mix hex.build`. `mix hex.publish` packages from
# the working tree, so a stale one left lying around is worth not committing.
*.tar

# Language servers
/.elixir_ls/
/.expert/

# Crash dumps. These embed process state, which for this library can include
# key material in flight.
erl_crash.dump

# Secrets. Nothing here reads a dotenv file, but the signing key is configured
# through the environment, and a committed key would end the library's only
# security property.
.env
.env.*

# Agent instructions and working directories, kept out of the repository for now
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/.claude/
/.design-delegate/

# macOS
.DS_Store
